  "notes": "{余|あま}る is an intransitive verb meaning to be left over or remain.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{余|あま}す→余す：27283_amasu⟧ (transitive, to leave over)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {余|あま}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ means 'there is left over' (resulting state)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦お{金|かね}→お金：00611_okane⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{余|あま}る: money is left over\n- ⟦{時間|じかん}→時間：00468_jikan⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{余|あま}る: time remains\n- ⟦{力|ちから}→力：01661_chikara⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{余|あま}る: beyond one's ability\n- {余|あま}り{物|もの}: leftovers\n\nNOTE: The word ⟦{余|あま}り→余り：17255_amari⟧ (too much, not very) is related to this verb.",
